    "sentence_translations": [
      "Ben’s Diary – Where Did My Money Go",
      "",
      "",
      "I have run out of money this week.",
      "Where did my money go?",
      "I have to think it over.",
      "",
      "On Monday I bought groceries, and used 150 yuan.",
      "On Tuesday, a friend and I watched a movie. I used 85 yuan.",
      "On Wednesday I went to eat with Lili, and used 53 yuan.",
      "On Thursday, I went to sing karaoke with Lucy, and used 100 yuan.",
      "On Friday it was too hot, so I went swimming. I used 20 yuan.",
      "On Saturday I cooked at home, and did not use any money.",
      "On Sunday a friend and I went to eat Peking Duck. I used 279 yuan.",
      "This week I used 687 yuan.",
      ""
    ]
